                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>A press release was issued by General Hodge at 4:30 p. m., August 13, giving
                    texts of telegrams exchanged between President Rhee and General of the Army
                    MacArthur. The invitation to General and Mrs. MacArthur to attend the ceremonies
                    inaugurating the new Korean Government on August 15 was accepted. (Telegram 662,
                    August 13, from Seoul; 895.01/8–1348) Speeches made at the inauguration by
                    General Hodge and by President Rhee were transmitted to the Department in
                    telegrams 665, August 14, 669, August 15, and 677, August 17 from Seoul.
                    (895.01/8–148, 8–1548, 8–1748)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
